#[section, $md:
    # Builder packages

    The selected project builder supplies packages tied to its artefact model.
    This keeps browser and rendering APIs out of the core language.

    The HTML builder provides source-backed compile-time helpers through
    `@html` and static URLs through `@web/site`, binding-backed runtime drawing
    through `@web/canvas`, WebGL2 rendering through `@web/graphics` and live
    browser state through `@web/page`. The
    @../../progress/packages-and-builders (packages and builders progress matrix)
    records current support and accepted next gaps.

    ## Package pages

    - @./html/ (@html)
    - @./canvas/ (@web/canvas)
    - @./graphics/ (@web/graphics)
    - @./site/ (@web/site)
    - @./page/ (@web/page)
]

